<section class="part-time" aria-labelledby="part-time-title">
  <div class="container">
    <!-- TODO(placeholder): copy to be reviewed by Jane -->
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h2 id="part-time-title">Part-time data help</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Many smaller districts can't afford a full-time data specialist, but the
      reports, deadlines, and questions don't stop. I offer part-time help,
      sized to what your district actually needs.
    </p>
    <ul class="facts">
      <li><strong>5 to 20 hours</strong><span>a week, adjusted through the school year</span></li>
      <li><strong>Remote first</strong><span>with on-site visits when they help</span></li>
      <li><strong>No full-time hire</strong><span>pay only for the hours you use</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .part-time { background: white; }
  .facts {
    list-style: none; margin-top: 2rem;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;
  }
  .facts li {
    background: var(--sand-100); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem;
  }
  .facts strong { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--brand-900); }
  .facts span { color: var(--ink-700); font-size: 0.95rem; }
</style>
